      *================================================================*
      * PROGRAM  : UTINTCAL                                            *
      * TYPE     : UNIT TEST DRIVER                                    *
      * PURPOSE  : UNIT TESTS FOR INTCALC (DAILY INTEREST ACCRUAL)     *
      *================================================================*
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. UTINTCAL.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY TESTPARM.
       COPY INTPARM.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN.
           MOVE 'INIT' TO TST-FUNCTION
           MOVE 'INTCALC' TO TST-SUITE-NAME
           CALL 'TESTLIB' USING TEST-PARMS

           PERFORM 1000-TEST-ACTUAL-365
           PERFORM 2000-TEST-COMPOUNDING
           PERFORM 3000-TEST-MINIMUMS
           PERFORM 4000-TEST-OTHER-BASES

           MOVE 'SUMM' TO TST-FUNCTION
           CALL 'TESTLIB' USING TEST-PARMS
           STOP RUN.

       1000-TEST-ACTUAL-365.
           PERFORM 8000-RESET
           MOVE 'HYSV' TO INT-PRODUCT-CODE
           MOVE 25400.00 TO INT-BALANCE
           MOVE 4.100000 TO INT-ANNUAL-RATE
           CALL 'INTCALC' USING INTCALC-PARMS
           MOVE 'HYSV 25,400 @ 4.10 ACT/365 = 2.853150'
             TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 2.853150 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE INT-DAILY-ACCRUAL TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ

           MOVE 20280601 TO INT-ACCRUAL-DATE
           CALL 'INTCALC' USING INTCALC-PARMS
           MOVE 'LEAP YEAR 2028 DIVIDES BY 366 = 2.845355'
             TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 2.845355 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE INT-DAILY-ACCRUAL TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ
           MOVE 'LEAP YEAR DAY BASIS 366' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 366 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE INT-DAY-BASIS TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ.

       2000-TEST-COMPOUNDING.
      *    25,500 * 4.10 / 36500 = 2.8643835.. - TRUNCATED NOT ROUNDED
           PERFORM 8000-RESET
           MOVE 'HYSV' TO INT-PRODUCT-CODE
           MOVE 'D' TO INT-COMPOUND-FREQ
           MOVE 25400.00 TO INT-BALANCE
           MOVE 100.000000 TO INT-ACCRUED-TO-DATE
           MOVE 4.100000 TO INT-ANNUAL-RATE
           CALL 'INTCALC' USING INTCALC-PARMS
           MOVE 'DAILY COMPOUND ADDS ACCRUED, TRUNCATES 2.864383'
             TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 2.864383 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE INT-DAILY-ACCRUAL TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ

           PERFORM 8000-RESET
           MOVE 'SVST' TO INT-PRODUCT-CODE
           MOVE 'M' TO INT-COMPOUND-FREQ
           MOVE 3412.18 TO INT-BALANCE
           MOVE 1.500000 TO INT-ACCRUED-TO-DATE
           MOVE 0.050000 TO INT-ANNUAL-RATE
           CALL 'INTCALC' USING INTCALC-PARMS
           MOVE 'MONTHLY COMPOUND DOES NOT ADD ACCRUED 0.004674'
             TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 0.004674 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE INT-DAILY-ACCRUAL TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ.

       3000-TEST-MINIMUMS.
           PERFORM 8000-RESET
           MOVE 'SVST' TO INT-PRODUCT-CODE
           MOVE 299.99 TO INT-BALANCE
           MOVE 0.050000 TO INT-ANNUAL-RATE
           CALL 'INTCALC' USING INTCALC-PARMS
           MOVE 'SVST BELOW 300 EARNS NOTHING' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 0 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE INT-DAILY-ACCRUAL TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ
           MOVE 'SVST BELOW 300 REASON BM' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 'BM' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE INT-REASON-CODE TO TST-ACTUAL
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ

           PERFORM 8000-RESET
           MOVE 'MMKT' TO INT-PRODUCT-CODE
           MOVE 2400.00 TO INT-BALANCE
           MOVE 3.250000 TO INT-ANNUAL-RATE
           CALL 'INTCALC' USING INTCALC-PARMS
           MOVE 'MMKT BELOW 2,500 EARNS 0.10 = 0.006575'
             TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 0.006575 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE INT-DAILY-ACCRUAL TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ
           MOVE 'MMKT REDUCED RATE APPLIED 0.10' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 0.100000 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE INT-APPLIED-RATE TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ

           PERFORM 8000-RESET
           MOVE 'CMMI' TO INT-PRODUCT-CODE
           MOVE 'A' TO INT-ACCRUAL-BASIS
           MOVE -420000.00 TO INT-BALANCE
           MOVE 4.050000 TO INT-ANNUAL-RATE
           CALL 'INTCALC' USING INTCALC-PARMS
           MOVE 'NEGATIVE BALANCE ACCRUES ZERO RC 04' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 4 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE INT-RETURN-CODE TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ.

       4000-TEST-OTHER-BASES.
           PERFORM 8000-RESET
           MOVE 'CMMI' TO INT-PRODUCT-CODE
           MOVE 'A' TO INT-ACCRUAL-BASIS
           MOVE 40000000.00 TO INT-BALANCE
           MOVE 4.050000 TO INT-ANNUAL-RATE
           CALL 'INTCALC' USING INTCALC-PARMS
           MOVE 'ACT/360 40M @ 4.05 = 4,500.00' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 4500.000000 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE INT-DAILY-ACCRUAL TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ

           PERFORM 8000-RESET
           MOVE 'XXXX' TO INT-PRODUCT-CODE
           MOVE '0' TO INT-ACCRUAL-BASIS
           MOVE 100000.00 TO INT-BALANCE
           MOVE 3.600000 TO INT-ANNUAL-RATE
           MOVE 20260915 TO INT-ACCRUAL-DATE
           CALL 'INTCALC' USING INTCALC-PARMS
           MOVE '30/360 ORDINARY DAY = 10.00' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 10.000000 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE INT-DAILY-ACCRUAL TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ

           MOVE 20261031 TO INT-ACCRUAL-DATE
           CALL 'INTCALC' USING INTCALC-PARMS
           MOVE '30/360 DAY 31 ACCRUES NOTHING' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 0 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE INT-DAILY-ACCRUAL TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ

           MOVE 20260228 TO INT-ACCRUAL-DATE
           CALL 'INTCALC' USING INTCALC-PARMS
           MOVE '30/360 FEB 28 ACCRUES 3 DAYS = 30.00' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 30.000000 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE INT-DAILY-ACCRUAL TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ

           MOVE 20280228 TO INT-ACCRUAL-DATE
           CALL 'INTCALC' USING INTCALC-PARMS
           MOVE '30/360 FEB 28 IN LEAP YEAR IS 1 DAY' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 10.000000 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE INT-DAILY-ACCRUAL TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ

           MOVE 'X' TO INT-ACCRUAL-BASIS
           CALL 'INTCALC' USING INTCALC-PARMS
           MOVE 'INVALID ACCRUAL BASIS RC 12' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 12 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE INT-RETURN-CODE TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ.

       8000-RESET.
           INITIALIZE INTCALC-PARMS
           MOVE '3' TO INT-ACCRUAL-BASIS
           MOVE 'N' TO INT-COMPOUND-FREQ
           MOVE 20260930 TO INT-ACCRUAL-DATE.

       9000-NEQ.
           MOVE 'NEQ' TO TST-FUNCTION
           CALL 'TESTLIB' USING TEST-PARMS.

       9100-AEQ.
           MOVE 'AEQ' TO TST-FUNCTION
           CALL 'TESTLIB' USING TEST-PARMS.
